speechtext:
The following are the commodities that are subject to compulsory inspection:	(a) All apples, plums
and pears exported from Canada; (b) All grapes moving from Ontario to any other province; (c) All fruit from British Columbia to any other province; (d) All potatoes and turnips from Prince Edward Island; (e) All potatoes and turnips from New Brunswick;
(f)	All fruit and vegetables from Ontario;
(g)	All fruit and vegetables from British Columbia.
